# WP 11.1B — Engineering Workflow Hardening.
#
# Names the reviewer GitHub should request automatically on every pull
# request. This formalises, in a GitHub-native, machine-enforceable way,
# a rule this project's own governance has already stated in prose since
# before this file existed (Engineering Governance §9, Product
# Approval): every merge into `main` requires an explicit, per-occasion
# approval from this authority, never assumed by the engineering tier
# that opened the pull request. This file does not change who that
# authority is — it makes GitHub's own review-request UI agree with what
# Engineering Governance already says.
#
# Repository administrators: pair this file with "Require review from
# Code Owners" in branch protection for `main` (see WP11.1B Engineering
# Workflow.md, "Required CI Status Checks & Branch Protection") — this
# file alone requests a review; it does not block a merge without that
# setting also being enabled.

